You play as an ordinary guy who, by chance, turns out to be a victim of the "Summoning Ritual", performed in a foreign realm. You will have to take on the role of the savior of a distressed Fuckville village, whose inhabitants needed a hero. Will you be able to handle it? It’s up to you to decide… but six hot girls won't leave you alone on this difficult path. Witches, beast-girls, goddesses, someone from your past life… Each of them will help you fulfill your destiny!

